array-index-is-T-or-undefined: REJECT a:rejected[possibly-undefined]
    a[possibly-undefined] number | undefined is not assignable to number; an index read (xs[i]), a find or a get may give undefined: give a fallback (xs[i] ?? 0), check it first (if (x === undefined) return …), loop with for…of in place of an index, or read the last element with xs.at(-1) and check that
accept-array-index-fallback: ACCEPT
